  "name": "Blackout and Freeze",
  "kind": "video",
  "blurb": "The two presses that save a set, under the Main Mixer's fade",
  "layout": "linear",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "slug": "note",
      "pos": {
        "x": 40.0,
        "y": 40.0
      },
      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Press Show on A, then press Freeze in the Main Mixer: the projector holds this frame while the patch races on underneath, and pressing it again cuts back to it live. Blackout takes the projector to black until it is pressed again. Both hold wherever the mix is shown \u2014 a window, Syphon, NDI \u2014 and Alt+click puts either on a MIDI pad."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
